2026-10-29T23:59:39.0154210Z == what a stream refuses, by name
2026-10-29T23:59:40.1559230Z   a reserved block type: exits 1 at "DEFLATE: block type 3 is reserved"
2026-10-29T23:59:41.4094900Z   a stream that ends inside a block: exits 1 at "DEFLATE: the stream ends inside a block"
2026-10-29T23:59:42.7174930Z   a stored length that is not its complement: exits 1 at "DEFLATE: a stored block's length does not match its complement"
2026-10-29T23:59:43.8518270Z   a stored block cut short: exits 1 at "DEFLATE: the stream ends inside a stored block"
2026-10-29T23:59:45.1136770Z   a zlib header that is not deflate: exits 1 at "zlib: not a deflate stream (method 7)"
2026-10-29T23:59:46.2233990Z   a zlib header whose check fails: exits 1 at "zlib: the header check failed"
2026-10-29T23:59:47.3304850Z   a zlib preset dictionary: exits 1 at "zlib: a preset dictionary is not supported"
2026-10-29T23:59:48.4665940Z   a zlib checksum that does not match: exits 1 at "zlib: the checksum does not match (00000001, stream says 00000002)"
2026-10-29T23:59:49.6824730Z   a zlib stream cut before its checksum: exits 1 at "zlib: the stream ends before its checksum"
2026-10-29T23:59:50.8931500Z   a gzip stream that is not one: exits 1 at "gzip: not a gzip stream"
2026-10-29T23:59:51.9289790Z   a gzip checksum that does not match: exits 1 at "gzip: the checksum does not match (00000000, stream says 00000001)"
2026-10-29T23:59:53.1442770Z   a gzip length that does not match: exits 1 at "gzip: the length does not match (0, stream says 5)"
2026-10-29T23:59:54.3043960Z   a gzip name that never ends: exits 1 at "gzip: the stream ends inside its header"
2026-10-29T23:59:55.5351280Z   a gzip header with a reserved flag: exits 1 at "gzip: a reserved header flag is set (FLG 32)"
2026-10-29T23:59:56.6794230Z   an incomplete literal/length code: exits 1 at "DEFLATE: the literal/length code is incomplete"
2026-10-29T23:59:57.8012040Z   an incomplete code-length code: exits 1 at "DEFLATE: the code-length code is incomplete"
2026-10-29T23:59:59.0687830Z   an incomplete distance code: exits 1 at "DEFLATE: the distance code is incomplete"
2026-10-30T00:00:01.3772340Z   a second gzip member cut short: exits 1 at "gzip: the stream is shorter than its header"
2026-10-30T00:00:02.8898530Z   a Deflater finished twice: exits 1 at "Deflater: finish was called twice"
2026-10-30T00:00:04.3006900Z   a Deflater written after its finish: exits 1 at "Deflater: compress after finish"
2026-10-30T00:00:05.6796440Z   a read of no bytes: exits 1 at "Inflater: read wants at least one byte, not 0"
2026-10-30T00:00:06.9415340Z   a level past 9: exits 1 at "Deflate: level 10 is not 0 to 9"
2026-10-30T00:00:08.1511790Z   a Deflater at level -1: exits 1 at "Deflate: level -1 is not 0 to 9"
